# Step 6 — Mixamo .fbx clips are user-supplied. Adobe TOS allows personal
# use but redistribution is grey, so keep user-side .fbx out of git.
# manifest.json + README.md inside the folder are tracked (they describe
# the contract); only the binaries are excluded.
src/assets/motions/fbx/**/*.fbx
src/assets/motions/fbx/**/*.FBX
